    <string name="koil_set_about_terms_body">KOiL records your own fuel purchases and reads publicly announced fuel price adjustments.\n\nAccuracy: prices follow station postings and official announcements. Reference prices, forecasts and conversions are for reference only and are not purchasing or investment advice.\n\nRisk: deviations caused by entry mistakes, data delays or device faults are borne by the user.\n\nThis is an open source project provided as is, without warranty of uninterrupted or error-free operation.</string>
    <string name="koil_set_about_privacy_body">Local first: fuel records, vehicle info and settings stay on your device. Nothing is uploaded to any server.\n\nLocation: used only when auto-detect province is on, solely to fill in the default province. No tracking, no upload.\n\nCloud sync (optional): data is backed up only to your own WebDAV server. Credentials are encrypted and stored locally; the developer has no access.\n\nCrash logs: kept on device only, exported manually, never reported automatically.</string>
    <string name="koil_set_about_licenses_body">Kotlin, Coroutines, kotlinx.serialization - Apache-2.0\nJetpack Compose, Room, DataStore, WorkManager - Apache-2.0\nMiuix (top.yukonga.miuix.kmp) - Apache-2.0\nKtor, OkHttp - Apache-2.0\nKoin - Apache-2.0\n\nSee gradle/libs.versions.toml in the repository for the full dependency list.</string>
